# Build output.
#
# Unanchored on purpose: the repository has more than one — the CMake build
# directory and each Rust crate's target/. A path-specific pattern would miss
# the copies inside crates/ and spike/.
target/
build/
build-*/

# Test fixtures.
#
# Audio files are not source. A DSD sample is 162 MB of one-bit audio; a file
# that size makes clone and history unusable. See test/README.md for what
# belongs here and what the checks need.
test/*.dff
test/*.dsf
test/*.wav
test/*.flac
test/*.aiff
test/*.m4a
test/*.mp3

# Editor and OS noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Local overrides. The CMake toolchain path is machine-specific and the file
# most likely to be edited by accident.
*.local
.env
.env.*
